# Repository workflow

## Branches

- **`main`** — All **source** changes belong here: Astro app (`src/`), content collections, `public/` assets, config, `planning/`, `.github/workflows/`, docs, and Cursor rules.
- **`master`** — **Production site output only** (built HTML/CSS/JS from CI). Do **not** edit `master` by hand or open PRs that target `master` for feature work.

## How changes go live

1. Branch from **`origin/main`**.
2. Implement and verify locally (`pnpm build` at minimum).
3. Open a pull request **into `main`**, get review, merge.
4. On push/merge to **`main`**, `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` builds and publishes **`dist/`** to **`master`**, which GitHub Pages serves at `https://ninjutsoo.github.io/`.

If it is not merged to **`main`**, it is **not** part of the deployed site (feature branches and open PRs are previews only).

## What must land on `main` (examples)

| Change | Location on `main` |
|--------|-------------------|
| Homepage / layout / styles | `src/components/`, `src/styles/` |
| News posts | `src/content/updates/*.md` (+ images in `public/assets/images/`) |
| Publications, projects, activities | `src/content/publications/`, `projects/`, `events/` |
| Profile, links, CV path | `src/data/profile.ts`, `public/assets/documents/` |
| New pages | `src/pages/` |
| Deploy / site URL | `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` (`SITE_URL`, `BASE_PATH`) |

## Do not

- Commit built `dist/` to **`main`** (CI produces the site).
- Copy-edit **`index.html`** on **`master`** instead of fixing **`src/`** on **`main`**.
- Treat **`master`** as the development branch.

## News feed

- List teasers: homepage + `/news/` via `NewsFeed.astro`.
- Full post: `/news/[slug]/` from the same markdown file.
- Authoring notes: `planning/news-posts.md`.
